OL,3,AHome secretary plans to tackle
OL,4,A'corrosive' perception of two-tier
OL,5,Apolicing
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood has
OL,8,Fannounced stronger guidance on police
OL,9,Fimpartiality to tackle what she called
OL,10,Fthe "corrosive and growing perception
OL,11,Fof two-tier policing".
OL,13,FShe told a conference of police chiefs
OL,14,Fon Wednesday that they should avoid
OL,15,Fwhat she calls "misguided attempts at
OL,16,Fcourse correction" where the pursuit of
OL,17,Fequality leads instead to differential
OL,18,Ftreatment.
OL,20,FRecent complaints about alleged
OL,21,Ftwo-tier policing have mostly come from
OL,22,Fthose on the right in politics.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
